diff --git a/shaders/cunny/README.md b/shaders/cunny/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..09b918e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/shaders/cunny/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# CuNNy2 fast-NVL GLES port
+
+Source: https://github.com/Blinue/Magpie/blob/dev/src/Effects/CuNNy2/CuNNy-fast-NVL.hlsl
+Author/model: https://github.com/funnyplanter/CuNNy
+Source SHA256: 8a250e626470b3e3887039c1c39caabe11eea269463b66a133330c208a440d83
+
+The original shader's GPL-3.0-or-later notice is retained. Original HLSL is
+included as CuNNy2-fast-NVL.source.hlsl. The GLES adaptation retains the weights,
+RGBA8 normalized feature quantization, point feature sampling, bilinear base
+image sampling, and the original four-subpixel residual shuffle.
+
+Four compute stages are split into nine fragment draws because this backend
+writes one output at a time. This is an initial correctness-oriented port;
+its performance is not equivalent to Magpie's compute implementation.
+Android mode 3 selects this 2x chain. Anime4K modes 1 and 2 remain available.
+
+Conversion and validation scripts: workspace android-build/convert_cunny2.py
+and android-build/validate_cunny2.py. No device image-quality or speed claim
+is made by the offline compiler tests.
